{
  "slug": "gorealo-home-equity-checkin",
  "name": "GoRealo — Homeowner check-in",
  "description": "Subject: Has your home or financial picture changed? | Preheader: Review your options with your current goals in mind.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Has your home or financial picture changed?</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">Review your options with your current goals in mind.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #243a59\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://www.gorealo.com/media/site-assets/gorealo-logo.svg\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#243a59;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">FOR HOMEOWNERS</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">Let’s take a fresh look at your mortgage options.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, life changes. If you’re considering a refinance or another mortgage goal, a side-by-side review can help you understand the costs and trade-offs.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">What would you like your mortgage to do differently?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirushtide/mailerfox/main/resources/email-templates/gorealo/assets/Loan-Savings-Math-GoRealo.png\" alt=\"GoRealo: Homeowner check-in\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Name the goal first</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Payment, term, cash-out, and total interest are different goals and can lead to different trade-offs.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Compare costs and timing</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Closing costs and how long you keep the loan can affect whether a change makes sense.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Review current terms</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Rates and available options change. Your actual eligibility depends on your profile and property.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with your goal and we can help you decide what information to compare.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#243a59\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/mortgage-rates/30-year-refinance/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Review refinance options</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Has your home or financial picture changed? Review your options with your current goals in mind. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR FOR HOMEOWNERS Let’s take a fresh look at your mortgage options. Hi {{first_name}}, life changes. If you’re considering a refinance or another mortgage goal, a side-by-side review can help you understand the costs and trade-offs. What would you like your mortgage to do differently? Name the goal first Payment, term, cash-out, and total interest are different goals and can lead to different trade-offs. Compare costs and timing Closing costs and how long you keep the loan can affect whether a change makes sense. Review current terms Rates and available options change. Your actual eligibility depends on your profile and property. Reply with your goal and we can help you decide what information to compare. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Review refinance options Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
